          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Can you draw the electron dot structure for cyclohexane? Straight chain, branched chain and cyclic carbon compounds, all may be saturated",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " or unsaturated. For example, benzene"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ",",
